{"course":{"format":"FlightCourse.v2","id":"snake-hunt-heights-01","revision":"r1","environment":"garage","locales":{"en":{"title":"Low, high, low","brief":"Catch 3 fictional humanoid targets by touching them in numbered order. Each catch lengthens a solid echo of your flown path. Avoid the glowing tail; fly above or around it.","lesson":"Use the usual manual throttle and flight controls. Aim for the marked torso around one metre above its platform. Pulses do not count. Wrong-order targets remain available. Blood is an optional visual setting."},"uk":{"title":"Низько, високо, низько","brief":"Спіймайте 3 вигаданих гуманоїдів дотиком у порядку номерів. Кожен дотик подовжує твердий слід пройденого шляху. Оминайте світлий хвіст або пролітайте над ним.","lesson":"Керуйте звичайною ручною тягою та нахилом. Цільтеся в позначений тулуб приблизно за метр над платформою. Імпульси не зараховуються. Цілі, яких торкнулися поза чергою, залишаються. Кров — необов’язковий візуальний ефект."}},"spawn":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":26000},"bounds":{"min":{"x":-34000,"y":0,"z":-34000},"max":{"x":34000,"y":18000,"z":34000}},"obstacles":[{"id":"target-platform-2","min":{"x":-2500,"y":0,"z":-8500},"max":{"x":2500,"y":2000,"z":-3500}}],"actors":[{"id":"humanoid-01","type":"patrol","role":"hostile","position":{"x":-14000,"y":0,"z":10000},"path":[],"speed":0,"radius":420,"height":2000,"health":50,"fireEveryTicks":0,"damage":0},{"id":"humanoid-02","type":"patrol","role":"hostile","position":{"x":0,"y":2000,"z":-6000},"path":[],"speed":0,"radius":420,"height":2000,"health":50,"fireEveryTicks":0,"damage":0},{"id":"humanoid-03","type":"patrol","role":"hostile","position":{"x":16000,"y":0,"z":-16000},"path":[],"speed":0,"radius":420,"height":2000,"health":50,"fireEveryTicks":0,"damage":0}],"steps":{"self-level":[{"type":"hunt-contact-v1","targets":["humanoid-01","humanoid-02","humanoid-03"],"ordered":true,"tail":{"linksPerCatch":2,"maxLinks":64,"neckDistance":4500,"radius":350}}],"acro":[{"type":"hunt-conta